1
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:34,646
You have done well, worthy of my trust.

2
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:45,846
Everything is going according to plan.

3
00:00:46,356 --> 00:00:48,350
I am about to be betrothed to Lady Rinkham.

4
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:51,323
Once that is done, I will be able to get close to Luang Witsanu.

5
00:00:53,384 --> 00:00:54,843
Then all that is left is to bide our time

6
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,612
until you gain the power to rule this city.

7
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:14,775
Dad, there is something I think you should know.

8
00:01:17,310 --> 00:01:20,006
The guard protecting the lady is not a man.

9
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:22,436
it’s a woman in disguise.

10
00:01:33,593 --> 00:01:37,730
Once I get rid of that guard, everything will be much easier.

11
00:01:40,090 --> 00:01:43,716
That fool Luang Witsanu even cast her aside himself.

12
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,218
Then proceed with the plan at once.

13
00:01:51,530 --> 00:01:52,393
We must not waste time.

14
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:10,738
Congratulations to you both on your successful engagement.

15
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:16,812
From this day forward, I ask that you take good care of each other.

16
00:02:17,990 --> 00:02:22,750
I look forward to the day you two share the wedding chamber together in the near future.

17
00:02:36,750 --> 00:02:37,556
Rinkham...

18
00:02:39,370 --> 00:02:40,252
Rinkham!

19
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:41,950
Dad, wait here a moment.

20
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,018
I shall fetch some water for you.

21
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:13,680
Put this slow-acting poison into Luang Witsanu's meal.

22
00:03:16,775 --> 00:03:18,770
It will kill him slowly and silently,

23
00:03:19,370 --> 00:03:20,424
without anyone suspecting a thing.

24
00:03:21,450 --> 00:03:22,584
And when he can no longer bear it...

25
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:28,923
...I shall step in to rule the city as his son-in-law!

26
00:03:37,970 --> 00:03:38,972
The time is near,

27
00:03:40,490 --> 00:03:42,196
Luang Witsanu, you fool

28
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:24,523
Kaew, you promised you would stay with me forever.

29
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,461
Where are you now?

30
00:04:37,740 --> 00:04:42,196
Why must you leave me to face these troubles all alone?

31
00:05:13,101 --> 00:05:15,458
I am sorry for everything.

32
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:25,138
I am so sorry I couldn't keep my promise.

33
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:16,516
1 week later

34
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,387
Take it easy, Dad.

35
00:06:28,170 --> 00:06:33,243
I will help take care of the kingdom's affairs on the days you aren't up to it.

36
00:06:36,450 --> 00:06:37,698
I can handle it.

37
00:06:38,970 --> 00:06:40,393
I’ve been by Dad’s side all along.

38
00:06:41,490 --> 00:06:42,996
I know what needs to be done.

39
00:06:44,584 --> 00:06:46,580
Ruling a kingdom isn't a game, Rinkham.

40
00:06:48,750 --> 00:06:50,572
As a woman, you shouldn't get involved.

41
00:07:30,710 --> 00:07:31,987
Are you still thinking about her?

42
00:07:37,895 --> 00:07:39,390
I always think about her.

43
00:07:40,850 --> 00:07:44,756
And the other day, you went there, didn't you?

44
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:48,344
To her engagement ceremony.

45
00:07:50,130 --> 00:07:54,196
I went, but she didn't see me.

46
00:07:57,243 --> 00:07:59,240
I just stood and watched from afar.

47
00:08:06,720 --> 00:08:11,384
I promised to take care of her,

48
00:08:13,590 --> 00:08:14,984
to protect her.

49
00:08:20,867 --> 00:08:22,560
But I couldn't keep my promise.

50
00:08:26,646 --> 00:08:30,443
I was thrown out like I was worthless—

51
00:08:33,236 --> 00:08:35,963
without even the right to stand by her side.

52
00:08:42,523 --> 00:08:44,412
She is in a dangerous place,

53
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,873
yet here I am...

54
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,338
Dad!

55
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:04,240
Hang in there.

56
00:09:05,150 --> 00:09:05,938
Here’s some water.

57
00:09:16,660 --> 00:09:17,852
Rest for a bit, Dad.

58
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:42,467
I’ll go boil some medicine for you.

59
00:09:53,230 --> 00:09:54,818
There’s only one pack left.

60
00:09:58,100 --> 00:09:59,138
I’ll go boil the medicine myself.

61
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,627
You go buy some more.

62
00:10:03,430 --> 00:10:07,212
But... I don't have enough money left to buy medicine for my dad.

63
00:10:10,892 --> 00:10:11,440
Go

64
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:12,436
Ming..

65
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:14,689
I have some savings left.

66
00:10:15,370 --> 00:10:16,184
Take it.

67
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:17,876
I really want to help you.

68
00:10:20,220 --> 00:10:21,341
Thank you, Ming.

69
00:10:22,350 --> 00:10:23,384
Go buy the medicine and keep it.

70
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:25,956
I’ll look after your dad for you.

71
00:10:38,390 --> 00:10:39,489
Do you have slow-acting poison?

72
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:40,283
Yes, I do.

73
00:10:52,221 --> 00:10:53,316
Do you have any more?

74
00:10:53,329 --> 00:10:54,203
Yes, I do.

75
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:08,830
Thank you!

76
00:11:12,130 --> 00:11:12,849
Excuse me, uncle.

77
00:11:12,873 --> 00:11:13,409
Yes?

78
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:16,652
What kind of medicine did that nobleman buy just now?

79
00:11:16,695 --> 00:11:17,698
slow-acting poison

80
00:11:19,944 --> 00:11:21,033
slow-acting poison?

81
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:19,446
You promised you would protect me forever...

82
00:12:20,860 --> 00:12:23,975
So where are you now?
